trator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":8,"title":"A rocket flying out of hair","illustrator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":9,"title":"A robot bee","illustrator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":10,"title":"Leaves floating on water","illustrator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":11,"title":"Water striders","illustrator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":12,"title":"Two insects","illustrator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":13,"title":"Many insects flying together","illustrator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":14,"title":"Three white patches on blue background","illustrator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":15,"title":"Two white patches on blue background","illustrator":"Adrija Ghosh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":null,"text":["ವ್ಯಾಕ್ ಕ್ ಕ್ ಕ್ ಕ್ ಕ್"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಜಿರಳೆ ನೋಡಿ ಓಡುವಿರಾ?","ಜೇನು ಕಂಡು ಚೀರುವಿರಾ?","ಇರಿ, ಒಮ್ಮೆ ಹತ್ತಿರ ಹೋಗಿ ನೋಡಿ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಕೀಟಗಳ ಲೋಕವೇ ಕೌತುಕ. ಮಷೀನು ತಯಾರಿಗೂ ಸಹಾಯಕ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬಲು ಪುಟಾಣಿ ಮಿಡತೆ ರೋಬೊ ಎಷ್ಟೆತ್ತರಕೂ ಜಿಗಿವವು ಸೊಯ್… ನೋಡುತಿರಿ ಒಂದಲ್ಲ ಒಂದು ದಿನ ಅಪರೂಪದ ಜಾಗಕೂ ಹೋದಾವು."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕಾಪಾಡೀ..."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮೀಸೆ ಮಿಸುಕಿಸಿ ಜಿರಲೆರೋಬೊ .","ಸಂದಿ-ಗೊಂದಿಯಲ್ಲೂ ನುಸುಳುವವು .","ನೋಡುತಿರಿ ಒಂದಲ್ಲ ಒಂದು ದಿನ","ಕಳೆದು ಹೋದವರ ಹುಡುಕುವವು."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಜೇನುರೋಬೊ ಹಾರು, ಗಿಡದ ಮೇಲೆ ಕೂರು. ಅರೆರೆ! ಇದು ನಿಜ ಜೇನುಹುಳುವೇ.","ನೋಡುತಿರಿ ಒಂದಲ್ಲ ಒಂದು ದಿನ ಮಂಗಳ ಗ್ರಹಕೂ ಹೋದಾವು.","ಮಣ್ಣು, ಅನಿಲವನೂ ತಂದಾವು.","ಗುಂಯ್ ಗುಂಯ್ ಗುಂಯ್ ಗುಂಯ್ ಗುಂಯ್ ಗುಂಯ್"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನೀರಜೇಡದಂತಹ ಮೈಕ್ರೊಬಾಟು ನೀರ ಮೇಲೂ ನಡೆವವು!","ನೋಡುತಿರಿ ಒಂದಲ್ಲ ಒಂದು ದಿನ ಕೆರೆ, ಸಾಗರವನೂ ಶುಚಿ ಮಾಡುವವು."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇನ್ನು ಮುಂದೆ ನಿಮ್ಮ ಕಣ್ಣೆದುರು ಏನಾದರೂ ತೆವಳಿದರೆ, ಝೇಂಕಾರ ಕೇಳಿದರೆ ಗಮನಿಸಿ ನೋಡಿ.","ಯಾರಿಗೆ ಗೊತ್ತು, ಅವು ಜಿರಲೆರೋಬೊ, ಜೇನುರೋಬೊ ಇರಬಹುದು."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬಾಟು ಕಂಪ್ಯೂಟರ್ ನ ಒಂದು ಪ್ರೋಗ್ರಾಂ ಅಥವಾ ಸರಳ ಕೆಲಸಗಳನ್ನು ಸದಾ ಮಾಡಬಲ್ಲ ಸಣ್ಣ ಮಷೀನು.","ಜಿರಲೆ ರೊಬೋಟುಗಳು","ಮಿಡತೆ ರೊಬೋಟುಗಳು"]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/49739-idu-keetave/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಜೇನು ರೊಬೋಟುಗಳು","ನೀರಜೇಡ ರೊಬೋಟುಗಳು"]}],"wordCount":126}